{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/208273a6f755ec92e49896e5a32f2706.poster.avif?t=1753434027\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/208273a6f755ec92e49896e5a32f2706.webm?t=1753434027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/208273a6f755ec92e49896e5a32f2706.mp4?t=1753434027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELCOME, UNIT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filthium Zero is a single-player action roguelite featuring a mix of vertical and ground combat. Purge the Filthium-infested zones of Earth, battle hordes of mutants, unlock powerful upgrades to survive, and watch the ragdolls fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: purge the corrupted zones of Earth by extracting Filthium from the water and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades secured by their predecessors. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VERTICAL &amp; GROUND COMBAT<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your Extraction Barrel from the sky for a heavy impact, slam yourself down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades.  <br><br>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0\ud83d\udc80<strong> </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514090?t=1753434027","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai