dds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VERTICAL &amp; GROUND COMBAT<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your Extraction Barrel from the sky for a heavy impact, slam yourself down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades.  <br><br>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0\ud83d\udc80<strong> </strong></p>","developers":["NOISE_HUM Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/0b4342915230377d5d0c0bc19f9d7003ee4e75c4/header.jpg?t=1753434027","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172911,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172911/movie480.mp4?t=1753285104","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172911/movie_max.mp4?t=1753285104"},"name":"Filthium Zero: Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172911/20b9d9219ca80c7744b178bcc4adc025ac2eece4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753285104","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172911/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753285104","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172911/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753285104"}}],"name":"Filthium Zero","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1060 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["NOISE_HUM Studio"],"ratings":{"dej